al others, we're waiting to see how their careers will turn out.","published":"2023-11-15T14:55:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/38895893/how-top-50-2023-recruits-done-college-freshmen","type":"Story","byline":"Blake Baumgartner and Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Raylen Wilson, No. 57 football recruit in ESPN Junior 300, commits to Michigan Wolverines","description":"Linebacker Raylen Wilson, the No. 57-ranked recruit in the ESPN Junior 300 out of Tallahassee (Florida) Lincoln, has committed to Michigan over Georgia.","published":"2024-01-23T15:55:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/recruiting/football/story/_/id/32823300/raylen-wilson-no-57-football-recruit-espn-junior-300-commits-michigan-wolverines","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"USC band won't perform at UCLA football game after members vandalized campus","description":"The USC Trojan Marching Band will not perform during Saturday's rivalry game vs. UCLA after members of the band vandalized a portion of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T04:02:46.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chris Creighton out as coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons","description":"Chris Creighton is out as head coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons with the school.","published":"2026-11-25T19:05:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595706/creighton-coach-eastern-michigan-13-seasons","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Judge denies SEC's request for TRO against LSU in Dec. 3 vote","description":"A federal judge denied the SEC's request for a temporary restraining order to keep LSU from interfering with a Dec. 3 vote of presidents and chancellors on whether to remove the school from the conference.","published":"2026-11-25T20:02:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50595702/judge-denies-sec-request-tro-lsu-dec-3-vote","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 13 Game Day Kickoff: Nothing compares to the outright hatred of a rival","description":"What to expect in Rivalry Week, from top games and players to teams on upset alert.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedaykickoff112526/week-13-top-games-upsets-preview","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Oklahoma State extends Morris with new 6-year deal","description":"Oklahoma State and head coach Eric Morris have agreed to a new six-year deal that will extend his contract through the 2032 season, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T17:00:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50594432/sources-oklahoma-state-extends-morris-new-six-year-deal","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-25T15:16:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4871074/raylen-wilson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raylen_Wilson"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Raylen Wilson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raylen_Wilson","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:20Z","intro":"Raylen Akin Wilson (born July 7, 2005) is an American college football linebacker for the Georgia Bulldogs of the Southeastern Conference (SEC).","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Wilson attended Lincoln High School in Tallahassee, Florida. As a senior, he had 117 tackles and as a senior and junior, he was the Tallahassee Democrat All-Big Bend Defensive Player of the Year. A five-star recruit, Wilson was selected to play in the 2023 Under Armour All-America Game. He originally committed to the University of Michigan to play college football but switched to the University of Georgia."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Georgia in 2023, Wilson played in 12 games with one start and had 15 tackles and 0.5 sacks. He returned to Georgia for his sophomore year in 2024."}],"family":[{"relation":"Father","name":"Robert Wilson","description":"American footballer, born 1974","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Wilson_(wide_receiver)"}]}}